  unitName: Goddess Lidith
  unitId: 30105
  unitNumber: 711
  description: A princess from the ruined Vriksha Duchy who exchanged her life to
    gain power. The Vriksha Duchy managed to hold on thanks to a few local victories,
    but the condition of the war only got worse. With her lifespan growing shorter
    as she used her powers, conversely she became even stronger than before. Once
    the vassals of her family realized what she had sacrificed for the people, Lidith
    shook her head with a smile, and continued fighting to help citizens evacuate.
    Watching such selflessness in action, many of her vassals decided to fight alongside
    her until the bitter end.
  summonDesc: Maybe I was ungrateful...<br>But that was the only way<br>in which
    I could save everyone...
  fusionDesc: It's so warm...<br>I feel like it's being healed...<br>My once broken
    soul.
  evoDesc: Summoner, command me!<br>Order me to fight!<br>I'll press forward if you
    say so!
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
